Pre-existing baseline at /search
--------------------------------

The /search route is served by:

    web/src/features/system/pages/SearchPage.tsx
    web/src/features/system/components/search/* (chips, filters, result rows,
                                                  etc.)
    web/src/api/hooks/useGlobalSearch.ts        # typed POST /search caller
    internal/api/search_handler.go              # GET /api/v1/search
                                                # (typed filters, no AI)
    internal/database/search.pg.go              # pgSearcher.SearchDrives /
                                                # SearchCharging / SearchAlerts

Important observations from the baseline survey:

  * `SearchPage.tsx` already composes its result list deterministically
    from `useGlobalSearch`. None of its filters or rows depend on AI.
  * The typed search backend (search_handler.go + pgSearcher) returns
    canonical Title / URL / Subtitle envelopes for each source kind
    (drive, charging, alert, vehicle). The N3 hydrator can therefore
    delegate to it instead of duplicating SQL.
  * No AI surface had ever been mounted on /search before; the page
    title, hero, filter chips, and result panels are the canonical
    baseline that must remain identical when ai_mode='off'.

